       fhir:definition [ fhir:v "This profile defines  how to represent Blood Pressure observations in FHIR using a standard LOINC code and UCUM units of measure.  This is a grouping structure. It has no value in Observation.valueQuantity but contains at least one component (systolic and/or diastolic)." ] ;
